==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*der-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*udariti}}. See also {{m|ru|удар}}, {{m|ru|драть}} and {{m|ru|раздо́р}}.

===Pronunciation===
